Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||08-23-99||09:08 PM||||Tonight I finally threw together the start of my personal web site. The car section is the only part that has anything worth looking at, as I barely spent any time on the rest of the site. It's mostly about Fieros, I have a few links and a few pictures. Please, send me your web page links and pictures of your Fieros!! <IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15><p>I have a few pictures of Fieros from people on the forum already, but I'd like to get more. Email me at steve@primeline.net or post the URL here with your photos and links..<p>here's the URL for the car page:<br>http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/steve/cars.htm<p>the main page is pretty boring, but it's located at:<br>http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/steve/<p>I plan on adding a lot to this site as it's pretty bare at the moment, but I just wanted to get something online.. let me know what you think!
